<div class="space-y-6">

  <!-- Retention First Mindset -->
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-orange-50 to-red-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border-2 border-orange-200">
    <h3 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-3">Why Retention > Acquisition</h3>
    <p class="text-gray-700 mb-4">
      If users don't come back, you're filling a leaky bucket. Don't focus on growth until you have good retention.
      10 users who love your product > 100 users who tried it once and left.
    </p>
    <div class="bg-white rounded-xl p-4">
      <p class="text-sm font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Retention Benchmarks (by product type):</p>
      <ul class="text-sm text-gray-600 space-y-1">
        <li>• <strong>Day 1:</strong> 40%+ (great), 25-40% (okay), &lt;25% (fix this first)</li>
        <li>• <strong>Week 1:</strong> 25%+ (great), 15-25% (okay), &lt;15% (broken)</li>
        <li>• <strong>Month 1:</strong> 15%+ (great), 10-15% (okay), &lt;10% (pivot or die)</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Finding Your Aha Moment -->
  <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border-2 border-gray-200 shadow-lg">
    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Find Your "Aha Moment"</h3>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-4">
      The aha moment is the action that predicts retention. Users who do X are 3x more likely to stick around.
    </p>

    <div class="space-y-4">
      <div class="p-4 bg-blue-50 rounded-xl">
        <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">Famous Aha Moments</h4>
        <ul class="text-sm text-gray-600 space-y-2">
          <li>• <strong>Facebook:</strong> Add 7 friends in 10 days</li>
          <li>• <strong>Slack:</strong> Send 2,000 team messages</li>
          <li>• <strong>Dropbox:</strong> Put 1 file in 1 folder on 1 device</li>
          <li>• <strong>Twitter:</strong> Follow 30 accounts</li>
          <li>• <strong>Airbnb:</strong> Complete a booking</li>
        </ul>
      </div>

      <div class="p-4 bg-purple-50 rounded-xl">
        <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900 mb-2">How to Find Yours</h4>
        <div class="space-y-3">
          <div class="flex items-start space-x-3">
            <div class="w-2 h-2 bg-purple-600 rounded-full mt-2"></div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-700"><strong>Step 1:</strong> Compare retained users vs churned users</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">What did retained users do that churned users didn't?</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start space-x-3">
            <div class="w-2 h-2 bg-purple-600 rounded-full mt-2"></div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-700"><strong>Step 2:</strong> Look for patterns in first session</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">What action happens within the first hour/day that matters?</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start space-x-3">
            <div class="w-2 h-2 bg-purple-600 rounded-full mt-2"></div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-700"><strong>Step 3:</strong> Test different thresholds</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">Is it 1 action? 3 actions? 10 actions? Find the magic number.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="flex items-start space-x-3">
            <div class="w-2 h-2 bg-purple-600 rounded-full mt-2"></div>
            <div>
              <p class="text-sm text-gray-700"><strong>Step 4:</strong> Optimize onboarding to get users there fast</p>
              <p class="text-xs text-gray-500">Remove friction, add prompts, celebrate the moment</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Retention Tactics -->
  <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border-2 border-gray-200 shadow-lg">
    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Retention Tactics That Work</h3>

    <div class="space-y-4">
      <div class="flex items-start space-x-3 p-4 bg-green-50 rounded-xl">
        <input type="checkbox" class="mt-1 w-5 h-5 text-green-600 rounded">
        <div class="flex-1">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900">1. Manual Onboarding (First 50 Users)</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">Book 30-min onboarding calls. Walk them through setup. Get them to aha moment in first session.</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">Scalable? No. Worth it? Absolutely. You'll learn why people succeed or fail.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-start space-x-3 p-4 bg-green-50 rounded-xl">
        <input type="checkbox" class="mt-1 w-5 h-5 text-green-600 rounded">
        <div class="flex-1">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900">2. Onboarding Email Sequence</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">Day 0: Welcome + quick win. Day 3: Feature tip. Day 7: Success story. Day 14: Check-in.</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">Tools: Customer.io, Loops, or plain Gmail for first 50 users</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-start space-x-3 p-4 bg-green-50 rounded-xl">
        <input type="checkbox" class="mt-1 w-5 h-5 text-green-600 rounded">
        <div class="flex-1">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900">3. In-App Prompts to Aha Moment</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">Tooltips, checklists, progress bars that guide users to complete the key action.</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">Example: "2/5 steps complete - Invite your team to unlock collaboration features"</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-start space-x-3 p-4 bg-green-50 rounded-xl">
        <input type="checkbox" class="mt-1 w-5 h-5 text-green-600 rounded">
        <div class="flex-1">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900">4. Weekly Check-Ins with Power Users</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">Schedule recurring calls with your top 10 users. Ask: What's working? What's frustrating? What would make you use this daily?</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">These users will tell you what to build next.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-start space-x-3 p-4 bg-green-50 rounded-xl">
        <input type="checkbox" class="mt-1 w-5 h-5 text-green-600 rounded">
        <div class="flex-1">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900">5. Re-Engagement Campaigns</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">When users go quiet (3-7 days inactive), send personal email: "Hey [Name], noticed you haven't been back. What can I help with?"</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">Response rate: 20-40%. You'll learn why they stopped using it.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-start space-x-3 p-4 bg-green-50 rounded-xl">
        <input type="checkbox" class="mt-1 w-5 h-5 text-green-600 rounded">
        <div class="flex-1">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900">6. Build for Power Users, Not Everyone</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">Find your 10% power users. Build features they request. They'll become evangelists and recruit others like them.</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">Don't try to please everyone at MVP stage. Go deep with your core audience.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-start space-x-3 p-4 bg-green-50 rounded-xl">
        <input type="checkbox" class="mt-1 w-5 h-5 text-green-600 rounded">
        <div class="flex-1">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900">7. Habit Formation Triggers</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">Push notifications, digest emails, reminders. Make your product part of their routine.</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">Example: "Your weekly report is ready" (every Monday 9am), "3 new matches found" (triggers curiosity)</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="flex items-start space-x-3 p-4 bg-green-50 rounded-xl">
        <input type="checkbox" class="mt-1 w-5 h-5 text-green-600 rounded">
        <div class="flex-1">
          <h4 class="font-bold text-gray-900">8. Talk to Churned Users</h4>
          <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mt-1">Call or email every user who churns. Ask: "Why did you stop using [product]? What would bring you back?"</p>
          <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-1">This feedback is more valuable than feature requests from active users.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Cohort Retention Analysis -->
  <div class="bg-gradient-to-br from-blue-50 to-purple-50 rounded-2xl p-6 border-2 border-blue-200">
    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Track Retention by Cohort</h3>
    <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 mb-4">Group users by signup week. Track what % return after Day 1, 7, 30.</p>

    <div class="overflow-x-auto">
      <table class="w-full bg-white rounded-xl shadow text-xs">
        <thead class="bg-gray-100">
          <tr>
            <th class="px-3 py-2 text-left font-bold">Cohort</th>
            <th class="px-3 py-2 text-left font-bold">Size</th>
            <th class="px-3 py-2 text-left font-bold">Day 1</th>
            <th class="px-3 py-2 text-left font-bold">Day 7</th>
            <th class="px-3 py-2 text-left font-bold">Day 30</th>
          </tr>
        </thead>
        <tbody class="divide-y divide-gray-200">
          <tr>
            <td class="px-3 py-2">Week 1</td>
            <td class="px-3 py-2 font-bold">20</td>
            <td class="px-3 py-2 text-green-600">45% (9)</td>
            <td class="px-3 py-2 text-green-600">30% (6)</td>
            <td class="px-3 py-2 text-yellow-600">15% (3)</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="px-3 py-2">Week 2</td>
            <td class="px-3 py-2 font-bold">35</td>
            <td class="px-3 py-2 text-green-600">40% (14)</td>
            <td class="px-3 py-2 text-yellow-600">25% (9)</td>
            <td class="px-3 py-2 text-gray-400">-</td>
          </tr>
          <tr>
            <td class="px-3 py-2">Week 3</td>
            <td class="px-3 py-2 font-bold">50</td>
            <td class="px-3 py-2 text-green-600">48% (24)</td>
            <td class="px-3 py-2 text-gray-400">-</td>
            <td class="px-3 py-2 text-gray-400">-</td>
          </tr>
        </tbody>
      </table>
    </div>

    <p class="text-xs text-gray-500 mt-3">Notice retention improving week-over-week? That's product-market fit emerging.</p>
  </div>

  <!-- Questions to Ask Power Users -->
  <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 border-2 border-gray-200 shadow-lg">
    <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-4">Questions to Ask Retained Users</h3>
    <ul class="space-y-3 text-sm">
      <li class="flex items-start space-x-2">
        <span class="text-blue-600 font-bold">•</span>
        <span class="text-gray-700">"What would you do if you couldn't use [product] anymore?"</span>
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-start space-x-2">
        <span class="text-blue-600 font-bold">•</span>
        <span class="text-gray-700">"How often do you use [product]? Daily? Weekly? Why?"</span>
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-start space-x-2">
        <span class="text-blue-600 font-bold">•</span>
        <span class="text-gray-700">"What's the main reason you keep coming back?"</span>
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-start space-x-2">
        <span class="text-blue-600 font-bold">•</span>
        <span class="text-gray-700">"What almost made you stop using it? What kept you going?"</span>
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-start space-x-2">
        <span class="text-blue-600 font-bold">•</span>
        <span class="text-gray-700">"If you could add one feature, what would make this 10x better?"</span>
      </li>
      <li class="flex items-start space-x-2">
        <span class="text-blue-600 font-bold">•</span>
        <span class="text-gray-700">"Who else do you know who has this same problem?"</span>
      </li>
    </ul>
  </div>

</div>
